Sek
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 38 DEAL NUIREB
COLUMN 6 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 2 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 8 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 10 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALL

NUIREB 8 FACE_ALL

JUC 4 FACE_LAST
JUC 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE {NUIREB, JUC} JUC
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
        DEST Size >= 7
    OR
        DEST Rank 1
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
MOVE JUC COLUMN
DEST Empty
DRAW
PILE ANY JUC Size > 0
$win
AND
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
        PILE ALL NUIREB Empty
